## Result

The active Go and Rust source paths use registered frontends, canonical VIR,
source-map and source-manifest validation, VC v1, and policy v1. Rust uses the
frozen registered compiler/build closure and both target libraries. Removed
predecessor interfaces and the unregistered Rust candidate path have no runtime
adapter, route, flag, fixture, or production selector.

Certificate v0 and proof acceptance are unchanged. Go source, contracts,
release registries, compilers, frontend results, VIR, source maps, manifests,
VCs, policy reports, and AI output remain untrusted helper artifacts. Only
canonical certificates and checked theory certificates accepted by the
configured source-free checkers support proof acceptance.

## Active release evidence

`release-report.json` remains the canonical generated, untrusted package,
checker, and release-provenance report. It records registered Rust targets,
build-input/dependency/cargo-fuzz/native-runtime/notice identities, both
manifest hashes, VIR/VC/certificate hashes, clean-build/path results,
source-free and independent reference-checker results, and axiom/profile
agreement. Verify it without rewriting:

```sh
python3 scripts/generate-release-report.py --check
```

The Go/VIR corpus manifest is `fixtures/vir-go/manifest.json`. It records two
clean byte-identical generations, 100 alpha functions, positive and negative
frontend roots, example/VC coverage, checker agreement, and zero unresolved
semantic dispositions. The reviewed migration report is archived at
`develop/migrations/archive/go-gir-to-vir-report.md` and is never executed.

## Reproduction

```sh
./scripts/check-no-active-gir.sh --strict
./scripts/build-release-bundles.sh --check-build-inputs rust
./scripts/build-release-bundles.sh --check all
./scripts/check-release-bundles.sh --fixture all
./scripts/regenerate-go-vir-corpus.sh --check
./scripts/regenerate-rust-payment-policy.sh --check
sudo ./scripts/check-rust-frontend.sh
cargo test -p mpk-cli --test frontend_runner
./scripts/check-fast.sh
sudo ./scripts/check-all.sh
(cd go-tools/go2vir && go test -count=1 ./...)
cargo test --workspace
python3 scripts/generate-release-report.py --check
git diff --check
```

